		(uuid "8c507992-e460-5db8-b9b7-2465569ced28")
	)
	(text_box "AIN0 = buffered VCAP (R703 1 k + C703 10 nF C0G), AIN1/AIN2 = OUT_A/OUT_B taps, AIN3 = capacitor NTC. Firmware:\nsingle-ended inputs referred to AVSS (MUX 1000b-1011b) need PGA_BYPASS = 1, gain 1 (SBAS501D 8.3.2.2); input range AVSS-0.1\nto AVDD+0.1 V; full scale = VREF_M = 2.5 V = 2,496 V of capacitor voltage. Reference: REFP0/REFN0 (external, VREF = 2.5 V).\nGain error (PGA disabled) 0.015 % typ, gain drift 1 ppm/K typ (4 ppm/K max is the PGA-enabled figure, used in the budget),\nINL 15 ppmFSR max, offset drift 0.3 uV/K max (SBAS501D 6.5). Absolute input current with PGA bypassed is given only as\ntypical curves (Fig 6-21..6-24): 20 nA assumed -> 20 uV across R703.\nCLK tied to DGND (internal oscillator, Table 5-1). DRDY and DOUT/DRDY both go to the main controller. HVM_CS_N pulled up by\nR712 100 kOhm (contract §5.6).\nDecoupling: AVDD 100 nF + 1 uF, DVDD 100 nF (Table 5-1: >= 100 nF)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224.52 31.75 0)
		(size 140 21.431)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb00d87f-7860-541c-a63e-46d7c2fa6043")
	)
	(text_box "VREF_M = 2.5 V, REF3425 (TI), main chain only"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 384.84 25.4 0)
		(size 140 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "97dea170-9138-53cb-bc3a-c77608c5fb72")
	)
	(text_box "REF3425IDBVR: +-0.05 % initial, 6 ppm/K max, 25 ppm / 1000 h then 10 ppm, thermal hysteresis 30 ppm (SBAS804G 6.5). VIN\n3V3_MAIN: dropout 100 mV max at 0 mA, load here about 0.5 mA (NTC bias 0.25 mA max, threshold divider 53 uA, ADC reference\n10 nA). Output capacitor 4.7 uF (stable 0.1-10 uF), input 100 nF. EN tied to IN. Force and sense joined at the part; sense\nrouted to REFP0 at layout.\nVREF_M is drawn as a power symbol made here (contract §4) by the reference's power_out pin; it is used on this sheet only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 384.84 31.75 0)
		(size 140 12.795)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "176d11ec-84e6-599d-9246-3f6013bcc52f")
	)
	(text_box "LOWV_OK: capacitor below about 55 V (D-61, §B14), LMV761 push-pull on 3V3_MAIN"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 384.84 113.125 0)
		(size 182.85 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f460fa2a-a5e1-55fe-bcd4-b1dfacf6c5f2")
	)
	(text_box "U703 -IN = buffered tap through R704 10 k / C704 100 nF (1 ms). +IN = threshold from VREF_M: R705 46.4 k / R706 1.00 k (0.1 %) = 52.74 mV, hysteresis R707 1.62 M\nfrom the output.\nOutput HIGH (LOWV_OK) while tap < threshold. Thresholds [CALC]: OK -> not OK at tap 54.70 mV = 54.6 V; not OK -> OK at 52.71 mV = 52.6 V (2 V hysteresis).\nBand [CALC, worst case]: LMV761 Vos +-1 mV over temperature (SNOS998I 6.6), follower 0.16 mV, resistors 0.1 % + 25 ppm/K, VREF 0.1 %, divider ratio +-1.5 %\nuncalibrated -> 50.4 V to 57.0 V. Requirement: OK only below 60 V -> fits with 3 V margin; S refuses a test permit above 50 V on its own chain (§13 fault 32).\nDefault: unpowered or off -> output low via the 100 kOhm pull-down on 09 = NOT OK (R11). An open VCAP_M_TAP reads 0 V = \"OK\": see capture notes, contract issue\nC-3.\nSDB (shutdown, active low) tied to V+ (always on)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 384.84 119.475 0)
		(size 182.85 19.272)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ec11562d-ca0e-547e-94d5-91c0ed054711")
	)
	(text_box "Bridge output taps OUT_A_TAP, OUT_B_TAP (shorted-switch and test-relay checks)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 121.38 0)
		(size 140 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
