			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "47132d8e-4aea-53b9-89eb-3fac2ad19748")
	)
	(text_box "NTC (10 k, B tolerance <= 1 %, §B9.2) is on the capacitor, wired from J1102 on 11 between NTC_CAP_M and GND [assumption:\nsheet 11 returns the NTC to GND]. Bias R710 10.0 k 0.1 % from VREF_M; AIN3 = 2.5 V x Rntc / (Rntc + 10 k): -20 C (about 68\nk) 2.18 V, 25 C 1.25 V, 70 C (about 2 k) 0.42 V. Ratiometric: the reference value cancels.\nR711 1 k + C708 100 nF filter. With 3V3_MAIN off, VREF_M is 0 V and nothing drives the NTC line (R7 satisfied)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.72 154.811 0)
		(size 140 10.636)
